Dialogue: 2,0:27:30.13,0:27:32.11,English,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(960,850)\fs62\fad(60,60)}I watched cups fly too fast on stage.
Dialogue: 2,0:27:30.13,0:27:32.11,Japanese,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(960,990)\fs44\fad(60,60)}ステージでカップが速く飛びすぎるのを見たよ。
