Dialogue: 2,0:27:36.13,0:27:39.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(960,850)\fs62\fad(60,60)}So, did you enjoy the island?
Dialogue: 2,0:27:36.13,0:27:39.00,Japanese,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(960,990)\fs44\fad(60,60)}それで、島を楽しめた？
